        "title": "Numbers",
        "goal": "Goal: confidently understand, say and use numbers in real A1 situations: age, phone numbers, prices, addresses and quantities.",
        "intro": "Learn numbers as a system: 0–20, then tens and the y pattern, then hundreds. Pay special attention to written accents and practical use.",
